   904	# Each predicate returns (ok, detail).  The normal run requires ok == True;
   905	# mutation_selftest() feeds each one a deliberately wrong input and requires
   906	# ok == False.  Mutations are run IN PROCESS because the sandbox the r1 critic
   907	# used is read-only (verdict O4, "Mutated copies: NOT RUN").
