+**D-intersection-angle-condition-number (REWORD, verbatim).** "For a clean intersection, let
+`A_x = T_xV (-) T_xZ` and `B_x = T_xW (-) T_xZ`. Define `J(x) = prod_i sin^2 theta_i(x)`, padding the
